      en: ["The museum opened in 1993.", "Babur was born on February 14, 1483.", "The house covers 300 square meters.", "The exhibition includes 50 handwritten manuscripts.", "Babur ruled the Mughal Empire from 1526 to 1530.", "The Baburnama contains over 500 pages of descriptions."],
